    <decisions>
        <name>Check_Score_Changed</name>
        <label>Close Likelihood Score changed?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Get_Partner_Request</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No change or new record</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Score_Changed</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record__Prior.Id</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Close_Likelihood_Score__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>$Record__Prior.Close_Likelihood_Score__c</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Tag_Prior_Health_Score</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Score changed on update</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>V6 draft edited 2026-11-02 to align New Business to the scoring rubric (all earlier v6 changes kept). Adds Partner Request Submitted (S2, 2 pts, floored to 2 when a Partner_Request__c exists on the Opportunity), Partner Engaged/Introduced (S3, 1 pt, from Partner Sourced or Partner Assist on the Opportunity), and S6 Quote Approved (2 pts, NB only, from the primary quote approval status, new PH_Calc_S6_* fields). Formula fields cannot be read on $Record in before-save flows, so these compute from the Opportunity directly. New Business is 20 milestones and 58 points. NB stage cap is 6; Closed Won counts S6, Closed Lost stays capped at 5. Other record types stay capped at 5. v5 is the active rollback. Revert notes: flow_v6_revert_notes.txt.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_Floor_Overage_Confirmed_Score</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!f_Set} = &quot;NB&quot;, 0, IF(BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Opportunity__r.Account.Last_Bill_Overage_Amount__c}, 0) &gt; 0, 3, 0))</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>New Business only. 2 when a Partner Request exists on the Opportunity, else 0.</description>
        <name>f_Floor_Partner_Request_Score</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF(AND({!f_Set} = &quot;NB&quot;, NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Opportunity__c})), NOT(ISBLANK({!Get_Partner_Request.Id}))), 2, 0)</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_Floor_Proposal_Created_Score</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!f_Set} = &quot;NB&quot;, 0, IF(OR({!$Record.Opportunity__r.OrderFormCreatedShared__c}, TEXT({!$Record.Opportunity__r.SBQQ__PrimaryQuote__r.SBQQ__Status__c}) = &quot;Approved&quot;), 3, IF(NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Opportunity__r.SBQQ__PrimaryQuote__c})), 2, 0)))</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Stage number used for points through stage. New Business reaches 6 at stage 6 or Closed Won. Closed Lost and all other record types cap at 5.</description>
        <name>f_MSN</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF(LEN(TEXT({!$Record.Opportunity__r.StageName})) = 0, 0, IF(ISNUMBER(LEFT(TEXT({!$Record.Opportunity__r.StageName}), 1)), MIN(VALUE(LEFT(TEXT({!$Record.Opportunity__r.StageName}), 1)), IF({!f_Set} = &quot;NB&quot;, 6, 5)), IF(AND({!f_Set} = &quot;NB&quot;, TEXT({!$Record.Opportunity__r.StageName}) = &quot;Closed Won&quot;), 6, 5)))</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>1 when Growth Driver scored 0 with a Not applicable reason (flat renewal): left out of points possible and the milestone count.</description>
        <name>f_NA_Growth_Driver</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF(AND(BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Growth_Driver_Identified_Score__c},0) = 0, CONTAINS(BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Growth_Driver_Identified_Reason__c}, &quot;&quot;), &quot;Not applicable&quot;)), 1, 0)</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Overage milestones scored 0 with a Not applicable reason (no overage, or no usage increase): left out of points possible and the milestone count.</description>
        <name>f_NA_Overage</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF(AND(BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Overage_Driver_Score__c},0) = 0, CONTAINS(BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Overage_Driver_Reason__c}, &quot;&quot;), &quot;Not applicable&quot;)), 1, 0)+IF(AND(BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Overage_Confirmed_Score__c},0) = 0, CONTAINS(BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Overage_Confirmed_Reason__c}, &quot;&quot;), &quot;Not applicable&quot;)), 1, 0)</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_New_Overage_Confirmed_Score</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!f_Floor_Overage_Confirmed_Score} &gt; BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Overage_Confirmed_Score__c}, -1), {!f_Floor_Overage_Confirmed_Score}, {!$Record.Overage_Confirmed_Score__c})</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_New_Partner_Request_Score</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!f_Floor_Partner_Request_Score} &gt; BLANKVALUE({!$Record.PartnerRequestSubmitted_S2__c}, 0), {!f_Floor_Partner_Request_Score}, {!$Record.PartnerRequestSubmitted_S2__c})</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_New_Proposal_Created_Score</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!f_Floor_Proposal_Created_Score} &gt; BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Proposal_Created_Score__c}, -1), {!f_Floor_Proposal_Created_Score}, {!$Record.Proposal_Created_Score__c})</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_NewReason_Overage_Confirmed_Score</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!f_Floor_Overage_Confirmed_Score} &gt; BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Overage_Confirmed_Score__c}, -1), &quot;Formula: the Account shows a last bill overage of $&quot; &amp; TEXT(ROUND({!$Record.Opportunity__r.Account.Last_Bill_Overage_Amount__c}, 0)) &amp; &quot;.&quot;, {!$Record.Overage_Confirmed_Reason__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_NewReason_Partner_Request_Score</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!f_Floor_Partner_Request_Score} &gt; BLANKVALUE({!$Record.PartnerRequestSubmitted_S2__c}, 0), &quot;Formula: a Partner Request exists on the Opportunity.&quot;, {!$Record.PartnerRequestSubmitted_Reason_S2__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_NewReason_Proposal_Created_Score</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!f_Floor_Proposal_Created_Score} &gt; BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Proposal_Created_Score__c}, -1), IF({!$Record.Opportunity__r.OrderFormCreatedShared__c}, &quot;Formula: Order Form Created/Shared is checked on the Opportunity.&quot;, &quot;Formula: the primary CPQ quote is in &quot; &amp; TEXT({!$Record.Opportunity__r.SBQQ__PrimaryQuote__r.SBQQ__Status__c}) &amp; &quot; status.&quot;), {!$Record.Proposal_Created_Reason__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Overage milestones count when the subtype includes increased usage (Midterm New Product), or for Midterm Other also when overage was actually scored above 0. Always true for other record types.</description>
        <name>f_Overage_Applies</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>OR(AND(LEFT({!$Record.RecordTypeId}, 15) &lt;&gt; &quot;012PU00000MDu2v&quot;, LEFT({!$Record.RecordTypeId}, 15) &lt;&gt; &quot;012PU00000MF0Xi&quot;), TEXT({!$Record.Opportunity__r.Opportunity_Subtype__c}) = &quot;Additional Product + Increase Usage&quot;, AND(LEFT({!$Record.RecordTypeId}, 15) = &quot;012PU00000MF0Xi&quot;, BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Overage_Driver_Score__c},0) + BLANKVALUE({!$Record.Overage_Confirmed_Score__c},0) &gt; 0))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>1 when a partner is tagged on the Opportunity (Partner Sourced or Partner Assist). Mirrors the Partner Engaged/Introduced rubric milestone without reading a formula field on $Record.</description>
        <name>f_Partner_Engaged</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF(AND(ISBLANK({!$Record.Opportunity__r.Partner_Sourced__c}), ISBLANK({!$Record.Opportunity__r.Partner_Assist__c})), 0, 1)</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_PH_Calc_Done_Through_Stage</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!v_PH_Stage} &gt;= 0, {!f_PH_Calc_S0_Done}, 0)+IF({!v_PH_Stage} &gt;= 1, {!f_PH_Calc_S1_Done}, 0)+IF({!v_PH_Stage} &gt;= 2, {!f_PH_Calc_S2_Done}, 0)+IF({!v_PH_Stage} &gt;= 3, {!f_PH_Calc_S3_Done}, 0)+IF({!v_PH_Stage} &gt;= 4, {!f_PH_Calc_S4_Done}, 0)+IF({!v_PH_Stage} &gt;= 5, {!f_PH_Calc_S5_Done}, 0)+IF({!v_PH_Stage} &gt;= 6, {!f_PH_Calc_S6_Done}, 0)</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_PH_Calc_Points_Earned</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 0, {!f_PH_Calc_S0_Points}, 0)+IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 1, {!f_PH_Calc_S1_Points}, 0)+IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 2, {!f_PH_Calc_S2_Points}, 0)+IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 3, {!f_PH_Calc_S3_Points}, 0)+IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 4, {!f_PH_Calc_S4_Points}, 0)+IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 5, {!f_PH_Calc_S5_Points}, 0)+IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 6, {!f_PH_Calc_S6_Points}, 0)</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_PH_Calc_Points_Possible</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 0, {!f_PH_Calc_S0_Points_Max}, 0)+IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 1, {!f_PH_Calc_S1_Points_Max}, 0)+IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 2, {!f_PH_Calc_S2_Points_Max}, 0)+IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 3, {!f_PH_Calc_S3_Points_Max}, 0)+IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 4, {!f_PH_Calc_S4_Points_Max}, 0)+IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 5, {!f_PH_Calc_S5_Points_Max}, 0)+IF({!v_MSN} &gt;= 6, {!f_PH_Calc_S6_Points_Max}, 0)</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
